  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "Singular points of klt del Pezzo surfaces of Picard number one in positive characteristic",
  "excerpt": "This repository contains the paper and a complete Lean 4 formalization of the uniform seven-point bound for rank-one klt del Pezzo surfaces in characteristic greater than two, together with the examples showing that the bound is sharp in characteristic three and false in characteristic two."
 },
